DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
12889::$$$message_0101_0000_0000$$$::"Hm, I guess this is everything."[lr]::
12890::$$$message_0101_0000_0001$$$::I compare the things in my hands with the note.[lr]::
12891::$$$message_0101_0000_0002$$$::I had to go out to Shinto for my work, so I also took over Sakura and Rider's errands.[lr]::
12892::$$$message_0101_0000_0003$$$::In my bag is a bottle of spices that I don't know how to use, and a hardcover book.::
12893::$$$message_0101_0001_0000$$$::"...Isn't half of the things Sakura asked me to get Tohsaka's?"[lr]::
12894::$$$message_0101_0001_0001$$$::There's some things that I don't even know if they're used for cooking (I don't even know if they're edible) or bottles that only have Chinese characters on them.[lr]::
12895::$$$message_0101_0001_0002$$$::Well lately, Sakura has been learning cooking from Tohsaka too, so she might be trying to challenge herself in cooking Chinese food.[lr]::
12896::$$$message_0101_0001_0003$$$::In that case, it's dangerous that Japanese food is my only advantage. Maybe I should compete and try learning German food from Sella too[line len=2]::
12897::$$$message_0101_0002_0000$$$::As I'm thinking that while walking, I feel like I see a familiar figure.[lr]::
12898::$$$message_0101_0002_0001$$$::I turn around and find the woman who came out of the store that handles clothes from overseas.[lr]::
12899::$$$message_0101_0002_0002$$$::She's carrying a lot of things with dangerous and clumsy footing.[lr]::
12900::$$$message_0101_0002_0003$$$::...Now, I feel like I've definitely seen her somewhere before, but who is that?::
12901::$$$message_0101_0003_0000$$$::"Oh, if it isn't Saber's boy."::
12902::$$$message_0101_0004_0000$$$::"...Huh, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Caster!?"[lr]::
12903::$$$message_0101_0004_0001$$$::"Oh? Why do you look shocked?"[lr]::
12904::$$$message_0101_0004_0002$$$::"Well, you know[line len=2]"[lr]::
12905::$$$message_0101_0004_0003$$$::You can usually only see Caster's mouth and hands from her robe, but more than something trivial like that...::
12906::$$$message_0101_0005_0000$$$::"...I'm surprised. You're a beauty."[lr]::
12907::$$$message_0101_0005_0001$$$::"...W-What's with you, all of a sudden?"[lr]::
12908::$$$message_0101_0005_0002$$$::"Well, that doesn't matter."[lr]::
12909::$$$message_0101_0005_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
12910::$$$message_0101_0005_0004$$$::...Oh no. I need to fix my habit of saying whatever is on my mind out loud.::
12911::$$$message_0101_0006_0000$$$::"That's a lot of stuff. Do you plan to bring all this home by yourself?"[lr]::
12912::$$$message_0101_0006_0001$$$::"What about it?"[lr]::
12913::$$$message_0101_0006_0002$$$::"Well, I thought it seemed like a lot."::
12914::$$$message_0101_0007_0000$$$::It's true that it looks like there's a lot of bulky-looking things.[lr]::
12915::$$$message_0101_0007_0001$$$::Well, Caster is also a Servant, so it must be light for her... I think.[lr]::
12916::$$$message_0101_0007_0002$$$::She lost miserably to Tohsaka in close combat, so I guess she's a normal woman other than her magecraft.::
12917::$$$message_0101_0008_0000$$$::"...Hmm. Will you help me if I say that it's a lot?"[lr]::
12918::$$$message_0101_0008_0001$$$::"I'll help. I'm about to go home anyway."[lr]::
12919::$$$message_0101_0008_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服01f(中)]I offer my hand to hold her things, but Caster looks at me weirdly.::
12920::$$$message_0101_0009_0000$$$::"Huh? Isn't it a lot to hold that much stuff by yourself?"[lr]::
12921::$$$message_0101_0009_0001$$$::"...Yes. Then, I suppose I shall ask for your help."[lr]::
12922::$$$message_0101_0009_0002$$$::Caster passes me the paper bag.[lr]::
12923::$$$message_0101_0009_0003$$$::It's heavier than expected, and it digs into the palm of my hand.::
12924::$$$message_0101_0010_0000$$$::"Woah, this is oddly heavy."[lr]::
12925::$$$message_0101_0010_0001$$$::"Don't worry about the little things. You're a man, right, boy?"[lr]::
12926::$$$message_0101_0010_0002$$$::"Mrgh..."[lr]::
12927::$$$message_0101_0010_0003$$$::I can't argue back if she says that.[lr]::
12928::$$$message_0101_0010_0004$$$::...Caster is friendlier than ever.::
12929::$$$message_0101_0011_0000$$$::"You should've had someone come with you if you were going to buy this much.[lr]::
12930::$$$message_0101_0011_0001$$$::Like Issei or Mr. Kuzuki."[lr]::
12931::$$$message_0101_0011_0002$$$::"Today, I'm shopping for my hobby.[lr]::
12932::$$$message_0101_0011_0003$$$::I cannot cause Souichirou trouble, and I do not think that Issei would help me."[lr]::
12933::$$$message_0101_0011_0004$$$::"Hmm."::
12934::$$$message_0101_0012_0000$$$::Issei and Caster's relationship doesn't seem very good as always.[lr]::
12935::$$$message_0101_0012_0001$$$::They don't fight, but they both seem to be formal towards each other.[lr]::
12936::$$$message_0101_0012_0002$$$::...That's a problem.[lr]::
12937::$$$message_0101_0012_0003$$$::There are also monks living at Ryudou Temple, unlike our place, so they may not meet each other one-on-one all that often.::
12938::$$$message_0101_0013_0000$$$::"...Well, I can't say much about that.[lr]::
12939::$$$message_0101_0013_0001$$$::Caster, I didn't know you had hobbies too."[lr]::
12940::$$$message_0101_0013_0002$$$::"R-Really? Isn't Berserker the only Servant that doesn't know leisure?"[lr]::
12941::$$$message_0101_0013_0003$$$::"Is that how it is?"::
12942::$$$message_0101_0014_0000$$$::Come to think of it, Saber enjoys eating, and Rider also likes reading books.[lr]::
12943::$$$message_0101_0014_0001$$$::The others must also have some kind of thing they enjoy, and even Berserker must've had some kind of hobby if he weren't summoned as Berserker.::
12944::$$$message_0101_0015_0000$$$::"So, what is this anyway?"[lr]::
12945::$$$message_0101_0015_0001$$$::"They're tools to make a ship in a bottle."[lr]::
12946::$$$message_0101_0015_0002$$$::"Hm."[lr]::
12947::$$$message_0101_0015_0003$$$::Ship in a bottle, ship in a bottle...[lr]::
12948::$$$message_0101_0015_0004$$$::I feel like I've seen one recently somewhere...::
12949::$$$message_0101_0016_0000$$$::"So the one that was on display at Issei's house was the one you made! I thought it was weird that there was something like that by the door of the temple."[lr]::
12950::$$$message_0101_0016_0001$$$::"T-That's rude! It was there since the chief priest said he wanted to put it there[line len=2]"[lr]::
12951::$$$message_0101_0016_0002$$$::"...By the chief priest, do you mean Issei's dad?"[lr]::
12952::$$$message_0101_0016_0003$$$::"Who else?"::
12953::$$$message_0101_0017_0000$$$::...I see. Issei's dad is a resolute man that oddly looks nothing like Issei.[lr]::
12954::$$$message_0101_0017_0001$$$::That man wouldn't think that displaying Caster's strange ship in a bottle at the temple or anywhere is weird... Oh yeah.::
12955::$$$message_0101_0018_0000$$$::"I remember now. Caster, can you stop sending weird things? It's bothering Saber."[lr]::
12956::$$$message_0101_0018_0001$$$::I don't know what she sent, but Tohsaka was grinning for some reason.[lr]::
12957::$$$message_0101_0018_0002$$$::That time...[lr]::
12958::$$$message_0101_0018_0003$$$::"It's what Caster sent. I'll check it just in case."::
12959::$$$message_0101_0019_0000$$$::She said and took it away.[lr]::
12960::$$$message_0101_0019_0001$$$::I just know that Saber, who was called over by Tohsaka, was troubled after that.::
12961::$$$message_0101_0020_0000$$$::"Oh, it looked good on her though."[lr]::
12962::$$$message_0101_0020_0001$$$::By "looked good," I wonder if the rest of the things are those kind of clothes.::
12963::$$$message_0101_0021_0000$$$::"...Caster, could it be that you're going to wear clothes like the ones you made Saber wear?"[lr]::
12964::$$$message_0101_0021_0001$$$::"How rude. Making those who look good in those types of clothes wear them is what's fun."[lr]::
12965::$$$message_0101_0021_0002$$$::"I see... But, I won't lend you Saber."[lr]::
12966::$$$message_0101_0021_0003$$$::I feel like Saber would look good in the cute clothes that Caster would buy, but I don't think Saber will like it.::
12967::$$$message_0101_0022_0000$$$::"Oh, that's too bad."[lr]::
12968::$$$message_0101_0022_0001$$$::"Same goes for you, is no one going to wear all those clothes that you bought? What a waste."[lr]::
12969::$$$message_0101_0022_0002$$$::"Yes, there are no young girls I can play dress-up with at the temple."[lr]::
12970::$$$message_0101_0022_0003$$$::"First of all, the only young person there is Issei."::
12971::$$$message_0101_0023_0000$$$::"Right. He's got potential. If only he were a girl[line len=2]"[lr]::
12972::$$$message_0101_0023_0001$$$::"I bet he wouldn't like to hear that."[lr]::
12973::$$$message_0101_0023_0002$$$::"Oh, but... Actually, he might be fine the way he is..."[lr]::
12974::$$$message_0101_0023_0003$$$::Caster looks off into the distance.[lr]::
12975::$$$message_0101_0023_0004$$$::...Issei cross-dressing?::
12976::$$$message_0101_0024_0000$$$::...::
12977::$$$message_0101_0025_0000$$$::"Give me a break..."[lr]::
12978::$$$message_0101_0025_0001$$$::That was the most I could say.::
912964::$$$message_9101_0021_0001$$$::"How rude. Making those who look good in those types of clothes wear them is what's fun."[r]::

